<title>UK: UK Finance Bill to be published on January 3.</title>
<headline>UK Finance Bill to be published on January 3.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Bill to carry into effect the measures announced in last month's budget by Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke will be published on January 3, the government announced on Thursday.</p>
<p>Financial Secretary to the Treasury Michael Jack said in a written parliamentary answer that explanatory notes providing additional information on the budget measures would be available from the Treasury on that day.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427767</p>
</text>
